# ROI bounds in base_footprint, in meters.
float64 min_x
float64 max_x
float64 min_y
float64 max_y
float64 min_z
float64 max_z
# Optional ground-plane removal in base_footprint. When enabled, points within
# ground_distance_threshold meters of ax + by + cz + d = 0 are removed.
# If a/b/c are all zero, the service uses the default horizontal plane z = 0.
bool remove_ground
float64 ground_plane_a
float64 ground_plane_b
float64 ground_plane_c
float64 ground_plane_d
float64 ground_distance_threshold
---
bool success
string message
sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 point_cloud
